howtoplay.pb.fb_i.p=Four ways to get a bee: catch it, find it in a nest, breed it, or convert it. Breeding has its own chapter.
howtoplay.pb.fb_catch.h=Catching
howtoplay.pb.fb_catch.p=Swing an empty §bBee Cage§r at a bee. A normal cage is used up when you release the bee; a §bSturdy Bee Cage§r comes back.
howtoplay.pb.fb_wild.h=Wild Spawns
howtoplay.pb.fb_wild.p=§7Grassy biomes (daylight):§r Bumble, Leaf Cutter, Blue Banded, Blue Mason, Mining\n§7Nether (underground):§r Magmatic\n§7Swamps, mangrove swamps, frozen and monster biomes:§r Slime
howtoplay.pb.fb_nest.h=Nests
howtoplay.pb.fb_nest.p=Nests slowly spawn bees. Each bee type has its own timer (shown in seconds). Right-click with a §bHoney Treat§r to cut all timers by 30%.
howtoplay.pb.fb_nest2.p=§bOak Nest§r — Bee 10s, Biomass 15s\n§bBirch Nest§r — Bee 10s, Biomass 15s, Blue Banded 30s\n§bSpruce Nest§r — Bee 10s, Biomass 15s, Leaf Cutter 30s\n§bJungle Nest§r — Biomass 15s, Blue Mason 30s\n§bAcacia Nest§r — Biomass 15s, Bumble 30s\n§bDark Oak Nest§r — Biomass 15s, Magnetic 30s\n§bStone Nest§r — Mining 20s, Dirt 20s\n§bCoarse Dirt Nest§r — Dirt 15s, Biomass 20s\n§bNether Brick Nest§r — Magmatic 25s\n§bNether Quartz Ore Nest§r — Quartz 25s\n§bNether Gold Ore Nest§r — Gold 30s\n§bGlowstone Nest§r — Glowing 25s\n§bEnd Stone Nest§r — Ender 35s
howtoplay.pb.fb_conv.h=Conversion
howtoplay.pb.fb_conv.p=Right-click a live bee with the right block to upgrade it (the block is used up):\n§bDiamond Bee§r + Netherite Block → Netherite Bee\n§bDuranium Bee§r + Voltanium Block → Voltanium Bee\n§bVoltanium Bee§r + Adamant Block → Adamant Bee
howtoplay.pb:finding=Finding Bees
howtoplay.pb:finding.title=Project Bee - Finding Bees
howtoplay.pb.br_i.p=Breeding makes a §cbaby§r bee from two parents.
howtoplay.pb.br_how.h=How It Works
howtoplay.pb.br_how.p=§b1.§r Put two filled cages in the §bBreeding Chamber§r (they are not used up).\n§b2.§r Add two matching flowers (one of each is used) and an empty cage for the baby.\n§b3.§r Wait 200 ticks (10 s). Parent order doesn't matter.\n§b4.§r Grow the baby in the §bBee Incubator§r with Honey Treats (10 for the Bee, up to 90 for Aetherium) before using it.
howtoplay.pb.br_list.h=Recipes
howtoplay.pb.br_list.p=Percent = chance of that offspring. Some crosses can give back a parent.
