howtoplay.pb:breeding=Breeding
howtoplay.pb:breeding.title=Project Bee - Breeding
howtoplay.pb.ma_i.p=All machines use §eDE (Dorios Energy)§r where energy is needed.
howtoplay.pb.ma_hive.h=Advanced Beehive
howtoplay.pb.ma_hive.p=Houses up to §b5 bees§r (7 with an Extension Box) and collects their combs.\n§7Slots:§r bee input, bee storage, catalyst, 3×3 output grid, upgrade slots (Speed I–V, Simulator).\n§7Craft:§r Planks x4, Honeycomb x2, Beehive, Campfire, Shears
howtoplay.pb.ma_bc.h=Breeding Chamber
howtoplay.pb.ma_bc.p=Mixes two bees into a baby. Needs 2 filled cages, 2 matching flowers and an empty cage. 200-tick cycle.\n§7Craft:§r Iron Ingot x7, Rose Bush, Bee Nest
howtoplay.pb.ma_bi.h=Bee Incubator
howtoplay.pb.ma_bi.p=Grows a baby cage into an adult cage. Uses energy and Honey Treats (10–90 per bee).\n§7Craft:§r Iron Ingot x7, Honey Bottle, Bee Nest
howtoplay.pb.ma_pcent.h=Powered Centrifuge
howtoplay.pb.ma_pcent.p=Turns a comb into resources and Wax. Each drop rolls its own chance. Uses DE; rarer combs cost more and take longer (3–10 s).\n§7Craft:§r Iron Ingot x7, Grindstone
howtoplay.pb.ma_fs.h=Feeding Slab
howtoplay.pb.ma_fs.p=Holds food for the Simulator Upgrade: 3 slots, 6 when you place a second slab on it. Put it in front of the hive, in front-and-below, or directly beneath it.\n§7Craft:§r Smooth Stone Slab, Chest
howtoplay.pb.ma_ext.h=Extension Box
howtoplay.pb.ma_ext.p=Place above or below an Advanced Beehive to raise bee storage from 5 to 7.\n§7Craft:§r Planks x8, Honeycomb
howtoplay.pb.ma_t.h=Troubleshooting
howtoplay.pb.ma_t.p=§7Hive not producing:§r no flowers within 5 blocks (for flower bees), output grid full, or no energy/catalyst.\n§7Simulator not working:§r the bee's food isn't in the Feeding Slab, or the slab is in the wrong spot.\n§7Can't release a bee:§r it is a baby — grow it in the Incubator.\n§7Breeding does nothing:§r flowers don't match the recipe, or no empty cage.\n§7Centrifuge idle:§r no energy or full output.
howtoplay.pb:machines=Machines
howtoplay.pb:machines.title=Project Bee - Machines
howtoplay.pb.it_cage.h=Bee Cage
howtoplay.pb.it_cage.p=Catches a bee. Used up on release.\n§7Craft:§r Leather x2, Honey Bottle
howtoplay.pb.it_sturdy.h=Sturdy Bee Cage
howtoplay.pb.it_sturdy.p=Reusable: returned to you when you release the bee. Baby bees can't be released.
howtoplay.pb.it_treat.h=Honey Treat
howtoplay.pb.it_treat.p=Fuel for the Incubator and speeds up nests by 30%.\n§7Craft:§r Honeycomb, Honey Bottle
howtoplay.pb.it_wax.h=Wax
howtoplay.pb.it_wax.p=Every comb gives Wax in the centrifuge (99%).
howtoplay.pb.it_base.h=Upgrade Base
howtoplay.pb.it_base.p=Ingredient for every upgrade.\n§7Craft:§r Honeycomb x4, Copper Ingot x4, Paper
howtoplay.pb.it_speed.h=Speed Upgrade I–V
